    {
      "record_id": "T-REL",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：空格句先回答前文提出的关系",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.sentence_fill.relation"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-REL"
      ],
      "independence_group": "fill-relation-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-REL"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "先给前文写一句关系：条件不足会带来什么问题，作者要推出什么补充判断。看到“若……可能……”后，空格更可能承接为限制条件下的建议，而不是绝对结论。",
      "record_sha256": "33f1f8e884b7fd32328dacf71bf895da73f3a476099631de89e8e98972066631"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-REF",
      "role": "teaching_asset",
      "title": "微课：代词必须有清楚的落点",
      "target_skill_ids": [
        "xingce.verbal.sentence_fill.reference"
      ],
      "candidate_misconception_ids": [
        "M-REF"
      ],
      "independence_group": "fill-reference-teaching",
      "content_origin": "original_lumi",
      "review_status": "draft_unreviewed",
      "target_candidate_ids": [
        "M-REF"
      ],
      "teaching_content": "将“这些说明”等代词替换为前文名词检验。若替换后找不到唯一对象，或对象在空格后才出现，句子就不能作为可靠衔接。",
      "record_sha256": "85575c85293168aba634284459253325bcf11f84b73da40fda7d24e8a8289a74"
    },
    {
      "record_id": "T-TOPIC",
